  "bodyHtml": "\n\n\t<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5871\" src=\"/media/archive/957e41f1a93d568f115c1723dd4f64d0874a01f30be18bffd11b5e197948eed0.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"288\" loading=\"lazy\" />\n\t\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-byline\">\n\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/archive/source-ff018cd9606c9d21e3a0/\" class=\"post-format-link\">Image</a>\t\t\t\t<span class=\"entry-author\"><a href=\"/archive/source-37895d34f8cef391272c/\" rel=\"author\" class=\"url fn n\"><span>pwsbuilder</span></a></span>\n\t\t\t\t<time class=\"entry-published updated\" datetime=\"2020-01-22T17:11:21-05:00\" title=\"Wednesday, January 22, 2020, 5:11 pm\">January 22, 2020</time>\n\t\t\t\t<span class=\"comments-link\"></span>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"entry-content\">\n\t\t\t<p>Today, January 22nd, General Meeting of the Guild of Harwich Artists. Demonstrating artist was Ellen C. Davies.</p>\n<p>Ellen primarily shows at the Cross Rip Gallery in Harwich Port.</p>\n<p> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5872\" src=\"/media/archive/e8afb0fea43f9e60df17c252ab50fcd89b6e4c658835efa903c3e9de11fb6849.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"282\" height=\"300\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5873\" src=\"/media/archive/88e4fc9443aa6a9081a5bc28f866d0ab65213af8294c8763e3c49a36d7e67072.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"296\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5874\" src=\"/media/archive/6d261404786b3916536809b10479fc9c726847b57daa4eaa01c1cb7d774689de.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"252\" loading=\"lazy\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5875\" src=\"/media/archive/054ca1be0337966e79cb9db53518bb6ab976c787175141feffc3f3f6ec5271d4.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"265\" /> <img loading=\"lazy\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-5876\" src=\"/media/archive/c6d8aa516cc79837652048fc3ebb35e229ba083f3cc742c7d4be9abfdaa5f095.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"300\" height=\"292\" /> <img loadi